data:{"type":"MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT","threadId":"vision-p6-wizard","runId":"r2","messages":[{"id":"msg_005ca20830016x5GVuAuUFibLI","role":"user","content":"我要把本会话数据目录的 region-sales-2026-08-result.csv 归档删除。请用 render_a2ui 渲染一个多步确认向导的第一步（surfaceId=p6-wizard）：WarningCard 说明将删除该文件 + ActionButton\"下一步\"（action event name=wizard_next，context 带 step=1 和 file=region-sales-2026-08-result.csv）。只渲染第一步。"},{"id":"msg_005ca21a6001k6vcbo9DXyO0fo-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user wants me to render a multi-step confirmation wizard first step using render_a2ui. Let me create the components.\n\nsurfaceId=p6-wizard, WarningCard + ActionButton \"下一步\" with action event name=wizard_next, context step=1 and file=region-sales-2026-08-result.csv.\n\nOnly render first step."},{"id":"msg_005ca21a6001k6vcbo9DXyO0fo","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_Q1tbSnCVLSh6s5KkyAfT4226","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"surfaceId\":\"p6-wizard\",\"components\":[{\"component\":\"WarningCard\",\"id\":\"warn\",\"title\":\"删除确认\",\"text\":\"即将归档删除文件 region-sales-2026-08-result.csv，删除后不可恢复。请确认继续。\"},{\"component\":\"ActionButton\",\"id\":\"next\",\"label\":\"下一步\",\"action\":{\"event\":{\"name\":\"wizard_next\",\"context\":{\"step\":1,\"file\":\"region-sales-2026-08-result.csv\"}}}}]}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_Q1tbSnCVLSh6s5KkyAfT4226","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_Q1tbSnCVLSh6s5KkyAfT4226","content":"Surface NOT rendered — gateway rejected it: missing root component (a component with id=\"root\" is required). Do NOT claim it was rendered. Fix the components (whitelist: Text,Image,Icon,Video,AudioPlayer,Row,Column,List,Card,Tabs,Divider,Modal,Button,TextField,CheckBox,ChoicePicker,Slider,DateTimeInput,MetricCard,DataTable,BarChart,LineChart,PieChart,InsightCard,WarningCard,ActionButton,Badge,Markdown) and call render_a2ui again."},{"id":"msg_005ca4751001ycvlJwUqQCC6c0-r","role":"reasoning","content":"Need a root component. Let me add a Column with id=\"root\" containing the WarningCard and ActionButton children."},{"id":"msg_005ca4751001ycvlJwUqQCC6c0","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_SvhgcIjzFLDHW7ljZhNh4013","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"components\":[{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\",\"children\":[\"warn\",\"next\"]},{\"component\":\"WarningCard\",\"id\":\"warn\",\"title\":\"删除确认\",\"text\":\"即将归档删除文件 region-sales-2026-08-result.csv，删除后不可恢复。请确认继续。\"},{\"component\":\"ActionButton\",\"id\":\"next\",\"label\":\"下一步\",\"action\":{\"event\":{\"name\":\"wizard_next\",\"context\":{\"step\":1,\"file\":\"region-sales-2026-08-result.csv\"}}}}],\"surfaceId\":\"p6-wizard\"}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_SvhgcIjzFLDHW7ljZhNh4013","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_SvhgcIjzFLDHW7ljZhNh4013","content":"UI surface \"p6-wizard\" rendered (3 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."},{"id":"msg_005ca551b001iMgjUc5k6XbvBw","role":"assistant","content":"已渲染向导第一步（p6-wizard）：WarningCard 提示删除该文件，配\"下一步\"按钮（事件 wizard_next，step=1）。"},{"id":"msg_005cac5360017178mgCaXNQlTL","role":"user","content":"A2UI_ACTION: {\"action\":{\"name\":\"wizard_next\",\"surfaceId\":\"p6-wizard\",\"sourceComponentId\":\"next\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-15T22:00:00Z\",\"context\":{\"step\":1,\"file\":\"region-sales-2026-08-result.csv\"}},\"version\":\"v0.9\"}\nThe user interacted with an A2UI surface rendered earlier in this conversation (see the action name, surfaceId and context above). Decide how to respond: answer directly in text, and if the UI should change, call render_a2ui with the SAME surfaceId to update that surface in place (keep the existing components, append or replace the result section). Actions like 筛选/提交/下钻/刷新 MUST update the surface via render_a2ui, not just text. Use the data workspace for any data lookups."},{"id":"msg_005cac54d001ZOYHlAew4qWPsa-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user clicked \"下一步\" on the wizard step 1. This is the second step of the multi-step confirmation wizard. Since it's a deletion, I should proceed to the next step — likely a second confirmation step. The user asked to render the first step only previously. Now step 1's next was clicked, so I should render step 2.\n\nThe overall task is archiving/deleting region-sales-2026-08-result.csv. Let me check the file exists first. Then render step 2 of the wizard. Since it's a destructive operation, step 2 might be a final confirmation with the actual delete action, or I could use request_user_confirm for the high-risk deletion.\n\nLet me think: the wizard is a multi-step confirmation. Step 1 warned about deletion with \"下一步\". Step 2 could be a summary + final \"确认删除\" button, maybe including a request_user_confirm for the high-risk operation.\n\nActually, since this is a deletion of a file (high-risk, irreversible), I should use request_user_confirm. But the wizard itself is a UI flow. The user asked to build a wizard. Let me continue the wizard to step 2: a final confirmation step showing file details, and a \"确认删除\" button that triggers the deletion event.\n\nLet me check the file exists first, and get its size/details to show in step 2.\n\nLet me update the surface to step 2 with a summary and a confirm button. The confirm button action event could be wizard_confirm. Also should I include a back button? Probably good UX.\n\nLet me check the file first."},{"id":"msg_005cac54d001ZOYHlAew4qWPsa","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_OSdGftOrPNUOOA0Rgctb3922","type":"function","function":{"name":"shell","arguments":"{\"command\":\"ls -la workspace/threads/vision-p6-wizard/region-sales-2026-08-result.csv && wc -l workspace/threads/vision-p6-wizard/region-sales-2026-08-result.csv\"}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_OSdGftOrPNUOOA0Rgctb3922","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_OSdGftOrPNUOOA0Rgctb3922","content":"-rw-rw-r-- 1 ubuntu ubuntu 87 Aug 15 22:18 workspace/threads/vision-p6-wizard/region-sales-2026-08-result.csv\n5 workspace/threads/vision-p6-wizard/region-sales-2026-08-result.csv\n\nCommand exited with code 0."},{"id":"msg_005cad5d5001EwTzRj2l2MmNLd-r","role":"reasoning","content":"File exists (87 bytes, 5 lines). Now render step 2: show file info + final confirm button. Keep same surfaceId p6-wizard."},{"id":"msg_005cad5d5001EwTzRj2l2MmNLd","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_K64dzmDtBYf5Mo5HjBm80955","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"components\":[{\"children\":[\"info\",\"back\",\"confirm\"],\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\"},{\"child\":\"infoText\",\"component\":\"Card\",\"id\":\"info\"},{\"component\":\"Markdown\",\"id\":\"infoText\",\"text\":\"**待删除文件：** region-sales-2026-08-result.csv\\n- 大小：87 字节\\n- 行数：5（含表头）\\n- 最后修改：2026-08-15 22:18\\n\\n⚠️ 删除后将**无法恢复**。\"},{\"action\":{\"event\":{\"context\":{\"step\":2,\"file\":\"region-sales-2026-08-result.csv\"},\"name\":\"wizard_back\"}},\"child\":\"backText\",\"component\":\"Button\",\"id\":\"back\",\"variant\":\"secondary\"},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"backText\",\"text\":\"上一步\"},{\"action\":{\"event\":{\"context\":{\"step\":2,\"file\":\"region-sales-2026-08-result.csv\"},\"name\":\"wizard_confirm_delete\"}},\"child\":\"confirmText\",\"component\":\"Button\",\"id\":\"confirm\",\"variant\":\"primary\"},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"confirmText\",\"text\":\"确认删除\"}],\"surfaceId\":\"p6-wizard\"}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_K64dzmDtBYf5Mo5HjBm80955","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_K64dzmDtBYf5Mo5HjBm80955","content":"UI surface \"p6-wizard\" rendered (7 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."},{"id":"msg_005cae154001GXYhkNAChK0Jjs","role":"assistant","content":"向导已进入第二步：展示文件信息（87 字节，5 行）并提示删除不可恢复，提供\"上一步\"和\"确认删除\"两个按钮。"}]}

